{"id":"2ae5e11bbb7aaaa2","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence.md","title":"ACA0 and Finitely Branching König Lemma","display":"thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence — ACA0 and Finitely Branching König Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence","aliases":["62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence"],"display":"thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence — ACA0 and Finitely Branching König Lemma","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-KonigLemma]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-thm-ACA0-equivalences]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem III.7.2","source_pages":[122,123],"source_pdf_pages":[140,141]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence — ACA0 and Finitely Branching König Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fae5d2b6e0fe0d0e\" href=\"?note=fae5d2b6e0fe0d0e\" title=\"62-df-KonigLemma\">62-df-KonigLemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eddcc3574973d5b4\" href=\"?note=eddcc3574973d5b4\" title=\"62-thm-ACA0-equivalences\">62-thm-ACA0-equivalences</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem III.7.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span><span>123</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>140</span><span>141</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KL},\\mathrm{KL}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{KL},\\mathrm{KL}_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fae5d2b6e0fe0d0e\" href=\"?note=fae5d2b6e0fe0d0e\" title=\"62-df-KonigLemma\">62-df-KonigLemma</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>；单射值域刻画见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eddcc3574973d5b4\" href=\"?note=eddcc3574973d5b4\" title=\"62-thm-ACA0-equivalences\">62-thm-ACA0-equivalences</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}Konig\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{KL}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{KL}_2\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}Konig\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{KL}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{KL}_2\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向以算术理解取仍有无限多个延伸的结点集，然后每步选择自然数最小的合适后继。KL 直接给其至多两个后继的特例 KL₂，因为 TwoSucc 逐结点推出 FB。反向给定单射 f，构造每个结点至多有两个后继的一般自然数树：第 n 个标签为 0 或 f 的唯一前像加 1；长度 k 的结点必须忠实记录 k 以内已出现的值。有界 Σ⁰₁ 理解提供每层结点。任一路径 g 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists m(f(m)=n)\\leftrightarrow g(n)&gt;0\">\\(\\exists m(f(m)=n)\\leftrightarrow g(n)&gt;0\\)</span>，形成值域。因此 KL₂ 已足以反演 ACA₀。标签可任意大，所以不能将该树误读为二叉树。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem III.7.2；纸面页 122, 123；PDF 页 140, 141。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-KonigLemma","status":"resolved","id":"fae5d2b6e0fe0d0e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-KonigLemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-ACA0-equivalences","status":"resolved","id":"eddcc3574973d5b4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt