_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}Konig\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{KL}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\{\\mathrm{KL}_2\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists m(f(m)=n)\\leftrightarrow g(n)>0","display":false}],"bytes":1937,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence|ACA0 and Finitely Branching König Lemma]]"},{"id":"2b6f9cd32d29dcf2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]；$\\mathrm{RT}(k),\\mathrm{RT}_{\\forall}$ 见 [[62-df-Ramsey]]；$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 及数词见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]；有限分支 König 引理见 [[62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence]]。$k\\in\\omega$ 是元层固定的标准指数，$\\overline k$ 为以 0、1、加法组成的有限数词。下式第一行的 n 则是对象语言数变量。"},{"id":"c183c4f51ea1c088","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论与 Cn 见 [[62-df-WKL0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]；模型与 J 见 [[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-jump-operator]]，归约见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]；ACA₀ 的 jump 闭包见 [[62-thm-ACA0-omega-models]]，KL 刻画见 [[62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence]]。在元理论中，$\\mathsf{Low}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf J(A)\\le_T\\mathsf J(\\varnothing)$。"}],"outgoing":["dd5e8930337c8b20","35af454d9caa8c9d","fae5d2b6e0fe0d0e","781620ab41bfeebd","eddcc3574973d5b4"]}